WEBVTT

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.260
It's moving!

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.690
CG has evolved!

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:10.450
Our manager has evolved!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.030
Evolved into what?

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.510
It's mad outta sight!

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.140
Is this our choreography?

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.690
Yes, for six gymnasts.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:22.660
So the choreography can 
be whatever we want?

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.670
You haven't memorized 
the rules of competition yet?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.460
Um...

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.940
Group routines are composed of 
freehand exercises and acrobatic elements.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.440
You need to have four 
acrobatic elements in total.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.400
Any fewer results in a deduction.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.830
Routines must be between two minutes
 and 45 seconds to three minutes.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.650
Going over time results in a deduction.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:41.970
Oh.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:45.340
We're counting on you, Educational Ace!

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.610
Don't call me that.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.990
We've finally got our six-man routine.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:52.990
Yeah.

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:55.320
And we're taking it to the Inter-High!

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.040
What is it? What's wrong, Watari?

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.540
I'm ready for action!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.320
Keep your cool, man!

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.250
<i>I'll get to perform with 
Misato-kun and my senpais!</i>

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:07.470
I've just been waitin' for this!

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:40.940
<b><i>Backflip!!</i></b>

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:44.790
Okay, let's do a run-through!

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:45.680
Right!

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:23.720
Keep your right leg held firmly in the bend,

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.160
and maintain your balance 
with your extended left leg.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:27.720
His acrobatic elements are looking okay,

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.240
R-Right.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.670
but the rest isn't there yet.

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:31.740
I'll run him through his paces.

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:33.190
At least, I would, but...

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:34.710
We suck, too.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:38.320
I think we're too accustomed 
to the four-man version.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.360
What's the plan?

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.530
Practice our asses off. What else?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.840
Let's try it again from the top!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:44.990
Right!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:54.460
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.460
A training camp?

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.460
Yes, partnered with another school
over the break next month.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:58.640
"Meeting and interacting with new 
people can be very inspiring."

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.630
That's what my wife says.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.760
D-Does she now?

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:09.430
Obviously, it can be educational 
to see how other schools practice.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.140
Did he make that up, too?

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:09.030
If you're curious, just ask.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.230
You might discover something unexpected.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:17.020
Seeing how others do things can also
 help you fix issues you're having.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:13.640
Um—

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:14.600
No, don't do it!

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:17.020
We believe ignorance is bliss.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.280
Yah!

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:22.320
So, who's the other school?

00:04:23.390 --> 00:04:26.620
Hakumei Private High School from Aomori.

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:28.740
Hakumei?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.420
That name sounds familiar.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:32.500
Shiro High.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.010
Shiro High?

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:36.730
Wait, isn't that...

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.130
Hakumei Private High School.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.630
AKA Shiro High.

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:44.400
Their men's rhythmic gymnastics team 
is a regular at the Inter-High.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.920
Why would a classy school 
like them wanna hang with—

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:52.140
Onagawa!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.170
Who cares 'bout being
 regulars at the Inter-High?!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.910
S-Sorry, Captain!

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.600
We're every bit as good as them!

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:57.360
I get it, I get it!

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.130
So... where will this training camp be?

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:04.860
Uncle! Uncle!

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:03.990
The gym at Sekiou University near us.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.870
They're sending six select 
 members to visit us.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.580
A select six?

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:15.870
They're coming all the way to Miyagi?

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:19.550
I mentioned we don't have the funds 
to travel, so they agreed to come here.

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:20.800
Isn't that nice?

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.310
<i>A training camp...</i>

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.710
How touchin'!

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.610
Okonomiyaki tonight?

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.510
Straight from its birthplace in Hiroshima.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.180
You've never even left Miyagi Prefecture.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.470
S'right!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.470
Captain!

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:35.870
What kind of sasakama do we have today?

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.480
Grated apple curry flavor!

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.610
We're offering it new this summer.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.860
Wouldn't a simple curry flavor be better?

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.610
The apples're the best part!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.720
Still, a training camp with Shiro High...

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:48.660
He said select athletes were coming.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:52.210
It'll be that gorilla and his merry men.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.130
Captain!

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.370
Come on! Don't make a mess!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.660
<i>A training camp, huh?</i>

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.510
<i>And I can't even do a handstand yet.</i>

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:09.970
<i>Okay!</i>

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:34.990
You okay, Fleaf?

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.630
F-Fleaf?

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:39.330
"Falling leaf!" Or "Fleaf" for short!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.290
I'd prefer something else...

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.520
Are you guys heading out somewhere?

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.400
Training camp starts tomorrow, remember?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:47.670
We have to go buy a few things.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:48.910
I'll come with.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:50.200
That's all right.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.680
We can handle it.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.650
We're half just shooting the breeze.
 Don't sweat it.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:57.240
Don't push yourself.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.730
Take your time. Try a change of scenery, too.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:00.780
See ya!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.690
Thank you!

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:04.440
Have a nice time!

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:14.840
They're being so considerate of me...

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.390
There he is!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:20.330
They found me!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.870
Wait up!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.380
It's just no use.

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.170
You suck.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.090
Hey, aren't you...

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:54.940
What a lousy-ass stag.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:56.470
What <i>was</i> that?

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.120
W-Well...

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.900
I know it's pretty lousy.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:02.440
That's why I'm here to practice—

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:03.790
There he is!

00:08:13.850 --> 00:08:15.470
Surround him!

00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:20.970
Wh-What are you playing?

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:22.900
Mass tag.

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.480
They're all "it."

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.640
What?!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.840
It's impossible!

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:13.650
We'll never catch him!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:15.300
What? Giving up already?

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.620
It's no fair!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.280
You jump around too much!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:19.450
Then I'll take a handicap.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:22.540
How about some three-legged race tag?

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.800
We'll be "it."

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:26.980
Okay?

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:27.980
Huh?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.090
<b>Zunda Shake</b>

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.750
Hey, this zunda shake is pretty good.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:40.850
No dice. He hasn't read a single one.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.720
He's not some kid. Quit worrying.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:46.230
We're at Zuihoden

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:46.230
We're at Aoba Castle

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.560
You really believe that?

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:48.150
Good stuff.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:57.560
Yeah!

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:59.630
Ah, we're too darn slow!

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.630
Over here!

00:10:01.630 --> 00:10:02.700
Sorry.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:08.250
Let's get ourselves in sync.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.880
O-Okay...

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:13.550
Catch us if you can! Catch us if you can!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:14.930
Ready... go.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.660
Over here!

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:19.930
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.430
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:22.430
Run away!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:26.430
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:34.260
One, two! One, two! One, two!

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:35.530
One!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.020
Two!

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.080
You buying those?

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:52.890
Still browsing.

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:53.690
Sure.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.820
Want to grab a cuppa?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.910
Maybe we should've invited Shotaro.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.990
Nah, he's pretty into his "practice" phase.

00:11:05.990 --> 00:11:08.640
Yeah, just like us in the beginning.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.230
True enough.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:12.060
Ryo-chan?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.440
Y-Yeah?

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:16.230
What's wrong?

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:17.790
S-Sako-chan...

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:21.180
I forgot... I gotta do something. 
 Go on back without me.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:22.480
What is it?

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:24.700
Where to next?

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.700
Just go.

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:28.330
Okay. Later.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.140
Huh? Misato?

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.920
What are you up to?

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.600
Nothing. Just shopping.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.550
For what, exactly?

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.700
What's this now, Pervert Ace?

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.640
Don't call me that...

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:11.450
You're getting ready for the training camp?

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:13.170
That was the plan, but...

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.710
<b>A local delicacy!\h\h\h\h\hFill your plate!
Beef Tongue Hayashi 
The flavors of a hand-made demi-glace sauce!</b>

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.170
Ma-chan! Ma-chan!

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:15.040
<b></b>

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.170
<b>A local delicacy!\h\h\h\h\hFill your plate!
Beef Tongue Hayashi 
The flavors of a hand-made demi-glace sauce!</b>

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.700
She's just the cutest!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.710
<b>Ma-chan</b>

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.690
"Fill your stomach and your 
heart with beef tongue."

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:26.180
"Local Sendai idols, the Tan Tan Girls."

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.390
Tsukidate-senpai, is that...

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.520
Moss.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.940
Isn't it adorable?

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:40.340
Kiraboshi.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.480
Kiraboshi?

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.360
It's just pathetic.

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:48.790
Look who's talking, Captain!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:51.910
This is different! 
I'm researching a rival business!

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.080
Oh, yeah?

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:55.840
Where's Futaba?

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:59.460
Oh, he's practicing handstands.

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.700
What's this?

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.930
The eve of our training camp 
and you're messing around?

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.480
Takase!

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:09.820
It's been a while.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.310
M-Mutsu!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.800
What are you jerks doin' here?

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.480
The camp's not till tomorrow.

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.870
We heard you finally got your six.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:20.150
Good for you.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:25.150
You're like a dying mountain hamlet 
saved by an influx of new villagers.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.660
We ain't no hamlet! Iwanuma's a city!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:32.580
Anyway, thanks for bravin' the wilds of your 
snowy mountain home to come pay us a visit!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.100
We're not from the mountains!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.990
It's the seaside, if anything!

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:37.870
And there ain't no snow this time of year!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.970
Oh, I beg your pardon!

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:43.240
But you sure you'll be all right 
all the way out here in Miyagi?

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.300
Whazzat?

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:49.280
I dunno what we'll feed a gorillapple 
who likes apples more than bananas.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:52.050
I'm getting by on your zunda.

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:55.810
Jeez, you people 
put this stuff in everything.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.900
Shut it, you Aomorillapple!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:02.470
Zunda, zunda, zunda!

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:04.360
What are they even doing?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.820
Talking trash, I think.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:08.870
Shichigahama, keep it chill.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:12.120
And you're literally drinking 
a zunda shake right now.

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:14.910
Say...

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:18.710
You're Ryoya Misato from 
Natori Fourth, aren't you?

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.290
I am.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:23.070
So you really did join Ao High.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:25.930
I can't believe you turned us down.

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:30.640
I wanted to join the Ao High 
men's rhythmic gymnastics team.

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:32.310
M-Misato...

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:34.600
Y-You liked us that much?

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:37.190
You shoulda said so sooner!

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:39.630
You adorable widdle Cutie Ace!

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:41.400
Don't call me that.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.480
You're a straight-talker. I like you.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:52.240
But you'll regret choosing
 Ao High soon enough.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.060
Bye-bye!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.700
Later!

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:01.730
You do rhythmic gymnastics, right?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.680
Yeah. I figure you do, too.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:05.420
'Cept your handstands suck.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.590
I only just started.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:11.670
Do you know how I can get better?

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:14.800
No idea.

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:17.630
I mean, handstands are so easy!

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.040
Why can't you do 'em?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.160
W-Well...

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:35.620
I just dunno.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.700
Is there anything in particular 
you watch out for?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.400
Nope.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.250
It's white.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:45.750
When I'm moving, it all goes white.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.520
White?

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:49.920
Yeah.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:53.330
My whole mind becomes a blank white canvas,

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.890
and I can feel everyone's hearts beating.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.080
It's the best.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:03.750
A blank white canvas...

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:21.670
Everyone's hearts beating...

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.900
That was pretty cool.

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:06.400
Thanks.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:11.380
By the way, at last year's prefectural—

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.470
Oh, crap!

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.760
I forgot to meet up with my senpais!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.530
They've been blowing me up!

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:19.840
Where am I? Where?!

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:20.970
Calm down.

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:22.100
I dunno! I don't know at all!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.880
Where are you meeting?

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.140
Here!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.290
Wait, <i>there</i>?

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:32.480
Huh?

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:34.720
Shotaro?

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:35.920
You're late, Mashiro.

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.160
Yeah, s-sorry.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.080
Hey, no big deal.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.810
You should be harder on him.

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:45.530
Getting mad won't solve anything.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:48.940
Besides, he knows what he did.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.710
Don't you, Mashiro?

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.780
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.730
Well, I'm impressed you 
made it here on your own.

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.410
I had a guide!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:02.010
Making trouble for your juniors, eh?

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.840
O-Oh, not at all.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:04.390
Huh?

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:05.120
<b>Hakumei Private High School
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics Club</b>

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.520
Shiro High?!

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:09.170
Shichigahama-senpai, 
Misato-kun, is this...

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:10.730
Ah, yeah.

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:11.820
Misato?

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.900
Misa-pon! It's been too long!

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:20.370
<i>"Misa-pon"?!</i>

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:22.090
I missed you so much!

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:24.380
Futaba, what are you doing with him?

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.660
We ran into each other at the park.

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.970
But I knew I recognized you!

00:18:28.970 --> 00:18:32.740
You were with Misato-kun at the
 prefectural tournament last year, right?

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:36.010
That was <i>you?!</i>

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.830
You only just remembered me?

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.430
Hey, what gives? 
Everyone knows each other?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:43.230
Looks like we're getting along already.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:46.020
Been a while, Sasahachi.

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.390
It's Sasashichi.

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:51.050
Oh, right... Shichi, not Hachi.

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:54.110
And these must be 
your much-rumored new recruits.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:57.540
Y-Yes! I'm Shotaro Futaba.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.780
Ryoya Mi—

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.410
I know who you are.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.980
Ryoya Misato.

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:06.090
I'm Shuji Mabuchi, men's rhythmic 
gymnastics coach at Shiro High.

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:07.210
It's a pleasure.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:09.550
It's been some time, Coach Shida.

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:10.830
Thank you for having us.

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:12.460
We're looking forward to it.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.840
You excited about this, Misa-pon?

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.140
Mashiro Tsukiyuki.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:19.970
Formerly of Natori Fourth Junior High's 
men's rhythmic gymnastics.

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:25.000
Began doing rhythmic gymnastics 
in his third year of junior high

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.890
and skyrocketed to win 
the national tournament.

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:30.140
And second place that year was...

00:19:32.090 --> 00:19:34.920
He beat Misato-kun?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.560
Hey, potato chips!

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:37.610
We have some new blood, too.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:40.240
Let's have a formal introduction.

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:44.430
I'm the Hakumei Private High School 
men's rhythmic gymnastics team captain,

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:45.910
Toru Takase.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:49.000
And I'm the vice captain, Yojiro Mutsu.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.770
Second-year Hideo Ominato.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:55.210
Kyoichi Ryugamori, also a second-year.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:55.990
A pleasure.

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:58.730
First-year Shunsuke Azuma!

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:05.260
First-year Mashiro Tsukiyuki!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.380
I got permission for just this occasion.

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:11.940
The gym is ours to use.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.690
Perfect.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:17.240
We'll show you what Shiro High can do.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.570
<b>Drive\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hDedication\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hCourage!!</b>

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:24.500
<i>This</i> is Shiro High...?
